OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet and windy day associated
OL,6,Fwith Storm Austen. The odd dry spell
OL,7,Fpossible to start the day, otherwise
OL,8,Fheavy outbreaks of rain push through.
OL,9,FStrong and gusty winds expected, with
OL,10,Fgales especially along the coast
OL,11,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain clearing away to the
OL,14,Fnortheast during the evening, leading
OL,15,Fto a mostly dry night with clear
OL,16,Fspells. Winds slowly ease through the
OL,17,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
