OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother wet and windy day as
OL,6,FStorm Boelo pushes eastwards.
OL,7,FWidespread heavy rain and disruptive
OL,8,Fwinds, these reaching severe gale
OL,9,Fforce along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,12,Fstrong winds and some showers continue
OL,13,FSunday, although drier for most.
OL,14,FRemaining unsettled into the new
OL,15,Fworking week with further periods of
OL,16,Fwind and rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
